DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate Art in the Beach with us! During the weekend of May 29th-31st the Beach Guild of Fine Art will be holding our Annual Spring Show & Sale at 140 Wineva Ave. in The Beach. \nCome and see original artwork in a variety of mediums\, sizes and subjects. Something for everyone!
