DESCRIPTION:A Group art show of Paintings by several artists.\nShow dates May 31 2026 – Sept 13\, 2026 \nART Opening June 7\, 2026 12-1pm\nWork removal and pick up Sept 13\, 2026 12-1pm \nPlease apply to Volunteer Curator Lauren McKiney Renzetti\nmckinleyrenzetti@gmail.com with “abstraction submission “ in the subject line\nSubmission should include:\nsend 5-10 jpegs with title in file name\nList of titles\, sizes and media of works.\nlinks to web site\, if available\nartist statement max 100 words\nshort biography max 100 words \nGallery location is Neighbourhood Gallery\, 310 Danforth Avenue in Mezzanine space above Neighbourhood Unitarian Universalist Congregation\nGallery hours in summer are 9am-9pm -5 days a week\, m-f\, provided the space below is not booked for an event
