SUMMARY:Community Centre 55 Annual General Meeting
DESCRIPTION:You are hereby notified that the Annual General Meeting of the members of Community Centre 55 will be held on Thursday June 18\, 2026 at 7:00 pm at Community Centre 55\, 97 Main Street for the purpose of considering and taking action with respect to the following: to approve the financial statements of Community Centre 55 for the fiscal year ended December 31\, 2025; to receive our Program report; and to fill vacancies on the Board of Management. For additional information\, please contact Reza Khoshdel\, Executive Director\, Community Centre 55 at 416-691-1113 ext. 225 or email reza@centre55.com or visit www.centre55.com .
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/community-centre-55-annual-general-meeting-2/
LOCATION:Centre 55\, 97 Main St.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
